This covers the measurements themselves: the telemetry, throughput figures,
output hashes and the synthetic corpora generated by scripts/gen_quality_corpus.py.

It does not extend to anything not authored here. In particular the wikitext-2
corpus used for the perplexity checks is not redistributed in this repository;
only per-chunk perplexity values computed from it are, in perplexity-chunks.txt.
Model weights are not included and carry their own terms.

Code in scripts/ and charts/ is MIT licensed; see ../LICENSE.
